{"seq":6,"slug":"analytical-chemistry","title":"分析化学与仪器","stage":"DONE","category":"chemistry","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/analytical-chemistry","rating":{"composite":3.59,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.05,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 分析化学与仪器分析\n\n分析化学是化学学科的核心分支之一，其核心使命是回答\"样品中含有什么物质、含量多少\"这一基本科学问题。从传统的滴定法、重量法发展到现代仪器分析，分析化学经历了从\"湿法\"到\"干法\"、从宏量到痕量、从离线到在线的深刻变革。现代仪器分析以物理学和电子学原理为基础，利用物质的光学、电学、质谱学特征实现高灵敏度、高选择性的化学测量。\n\n## 定位与目标读者\n\n本知识库面向具有普通化学和基础物理知识的自学者，系统梳理分析化学中最重要的仪器分析技术。这些技术在环境监测、食品安全、临床诊断、法医鉴定、材料科学、药物研发等领域发挥着不可替代的作用。\n\n## 前置知识\n\n- 普通化学基础（化学平衡、酸碱理论、氧化还原）\n- 基础物理学（电磁波、光学、电学基本概念）\n- 初等统计学（均值、标准差、置信区间）\n- 了解基本的实验室操作概念\n\n## 内容结构\n\n第一章**分离技术**涵盖色谱法、电泳法、萃取法，将复杂混合物拆分为可识别的组分。\n\n第二章**质谱分析**通过测量离子质荷比实现分子鉴定与结构解析。\n\n第三章**元素分析**涵盖原子光谱、X 射线技术、ICP-MS，实现从痕量到超痕量的元素定量。\n\n第四章**电分析化学**利用电化学信号实现快速、原位的化学检测，涵盖电位法、伏安法、生物传感器。\n\n## 学习路径\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n    A[分离技术] --> B[质谱分析]\n    B --> C[元素分析]\n    C --> D[电分析化学]\n```\n\n随着微型化、智能化、多维联用技术的发展，分析化学正从实验室走向现场、从大型仪器走向便携设备、从单一检测走向多组学整合，持续推动科学研究与社会进步。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"separation-techniques","title":"分离技术","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/analytical-chemistry/separation-techniques","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"chromatography-principles","title":"色谱原理与分类（Chromatography Principles）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/analytical-chemistry/separation-techniques/chromatography-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"hplc-gc","title":"高效液相色谱与气相色谱（HPLC & GC）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/analytical-chemistry/separation-techniques/hplc-gc"},{"seq":3,"slug":"electrophoresis-extraction","title":"电泳与萃取分离（Electrophoresis & Extraction）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/analytical-chemistry/separation-techniques/electrophoresis-extraction"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"mass-spectrometry","title":"质谱分析","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/analytical-chemistry/mass-spectrometry","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ionization-methods","title":"电离方法（Ionization Methods）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/analytical-chemistry/mass-spectrometry/ionization-methods"},{"seq":2,"slug":"mass-analyzers","title":"质量分析器类型（Mass Analyzers）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/analytical-chemistry/mass-spectrometry/mass-analyzers"},{"seq":3,"slug":"tandem-ms-applications","title":"串联质谱与应用（Tandem MS & Applications）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/analytical-chemistry/mass-spectrometry/tandem-ms-applications"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"elemental-analysis","title":"元素分析","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/analytical-chemistry/elemental-analysis","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"atomic-absorption-emission","title":"原子吸收与发射光谱（Atomic Absorption & Emission Spectroscopy）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/analytical-chemistry/elemental-analysis/atomic-absorption-emission"},{"seq":2,"slug":"xrf-xps","title":"X 射线荧光与光电子能谱（XRF & XPS）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/analytical-chemistry/elemental-analysis/xrf-xps"},{"seq":3,"slug":"icp-ms-oes","title":"ICP-MS 与 ICP-OES（电感耦合等离子体质谱与光发射光谱）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/analytical-chemistry/elemental-analysis/icp-ms-oes"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"electroanalytical","title":"电分析化学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/analytical-chemistry/electroanalytical","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"potentiometry","title":"电位分析法（Potentiometry）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/analytical-chemistry/electroanalytical/potentiometry"},{"seq":2,"slug":"voltammetry","title":"伏安分析法（Voltammetry）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/analytical-chemistry/electroanalytical/voltammetry"},{"seq":3,"slug":"biosensors-electrochemical","title":"电化学生物传感器（Electrochemical Biosensors）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/analytical-chemistry/electroanalytical/biosensors-electrochemical"}]}]}